# The build context is the repo root because the image builds the whole workspace
# (apps/api imports @saas/shared and @saas/db through project references). Keeping
# node_modules and dist out is what makes `docker build` take seconds instead of
# minutes, and it stops a Linux-built node_modules from being copied into Alpine.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
loadtests/results
.git
.github
.dockerignore
.env
**/.env
**/*.log
docs
README.md
LICENSE
